1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:52,920
Did you hear ?

25
00:01:53,040 --> 00:01:55,520
Someone is targeted by the Hundred Days Execution Order.

26
00:01:55,560 --> 00:01:57,360
He also killed a group of Core Formation cultivators.

27
00:01:57,440 --> 00:02:00,440
I heard ! Even the Grand Elder was killed !

28
00:02:00,520 --> 00:02:01,800
This is too sinister...

29
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:03,320
Is he Nascent Soul ?

30
00:02:05,640 --> 00:02:06,640
This is... wait...

31
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:18,120
It's him !

32
00:02:18,240 --> 00:02:19,520
Run ! Quick !

33
00:02:28,560 --> 00:02:30,320
This fiend broke Xue Ming's formation

34
00:02:30,560 --> 00:02:32,040
like it was nothing...

35
00:02:32,960 --> 00:02:34,440
If we obey him,

36
00:02:34,880 --> 00:02:36,360
we might be able to survive.

37
00:02:36,640 --> 00:02:38,480
This person's strength is terrifying.

38
00:02:38,880 --> 00:02:40,880
We must be very careful.

39
00:02:42,040 --> 00:02:44,640
It seems becoming his disciple was the right choice.

40
00:02:44,920 --> 00:02:46,000
If I follow him,

41
00:02:46,240 --> 00:02:47,760
I'll be able to do as I please

42
00:02:47,760 --> 00:02:49,320
in the outer Sea of Devils.

43
00:02:49,960 --> 00:02:52,800
I need to establish a foothold in the Sea of Devils

44
00:02:53,480 --> 00:02:56,440
and the Fighting Evil Sect is my best choice for that.

45
00:02:59,920 --> 00:03:02,160
I used a bit too much of my Ji Realm earlier

46
00:03:02,680 --> 00:03:03,640
but it's okay.

47
00:03:03,920 --> 00:03:05,280
It should recover quickly

48
00:03:05,280 --> 00:03:07,160
if I nourish it within my Sea of Consciousness.

49
00:03:12,320 --> 00:03:13,800
He actually did it....

50
00:03:14,640 --> 00:03:15,880
From now on,

51
00:03:16,880 --> 00:03:19,280
I am the strongest person below Nascent Soul.

52
00:03:22,720 --> 00:03:24,480
When I first met him,

53
00:03:25,280 --> 00:03:26,920
I thought he was Sun Youcai.

54
00:03:27,160 --> 00:03:29,000
I nearly caused a misunderstanding.

55
00:03:30,120 --> 00:03:33,480
Had we really fought back then,

56
00:03:34,200 --> 00:03:36,880
he would've slaughtered everyone present.

57
00:03:37,720 --> 00:03:41,800
He wouldn't even have shown an ounce of mercy towards me.

58
00:03:42,640 --> 00:03:43,880
You don't need to worry.

59
00:03:44,480 --> 00:03:46,200
After I'm done with all this,

60
00:03:46,200 --> 00:03:48,440
I'll take you back to the Burning Fire Alliance.

61
00:04:10,960 --> 00:04:14,200
Fellow cultivator afflicted by the Hundred Days Execution Order,

62
00:04:14,240 --> 00:04:17,080
Grand Elder Qian Kun provoked you

63
00:04:17,560 --> 00:04:19,200
and killing him was justified.

64
00:04:19,440 --> 00:04:22,600
You already killed dozens of our disciples.

65
00:04:23,080 --> 00:04:24,080
However...

66
00:04:24,400 --> 00:04:28,920
Do you truly think my Fighting Evil Sect is made of lambs to prey on ?

67
00:04:29,960 --> 00:04:34,480
Formation !

68
00:04:34,720 --> 00:04:35,840
10 000 cultivators in a formation...

69
00:04:35,840 --> 00:04:41,560
The headquarters of the Fighting Evil Sect has 13 562 members

70
00:04:41,880 --> 00:04:43,760
and they're all here !

71
00:04:44,480 --> 00:04:47,000
The Great Dragon Formation actually exists !

72
00:04:55,280 --> 00:04:57,360
Xie Donglai
Fighting Evil Sect Leader
Late stage Core Formation

73
00:04:55,920 --> 00:04:59,360
The Great Dragon Formation is the protection formation of the Fighting Evil Sect.

74
00:04:59,760 --> 00:05:02,120
Unless you are a Nascent Soul cultivator,

75
00:05:02,280 --> 00:05:03,520
it's impossible to break.

76
00:05:05,920 --> 00:05:07,960
The formation isn't fully active yet.

77
00:05:07,960 --> 00:05:11,640
My brother and I are Elders of a branch of the sect

78
00:05:11,920 --> 00:05:15,640
Please let us negotiate with the Sect Leader for you.

79
00:05:15,880 --> 00:05:16,760
Yes, yes !

80
00:05:17,160 --> 00:05:19,480
We can still stop the formation now.

81
00:05:19,960 --> 00:05:21,000
Once it's activated,

82
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:22,360
it will be too late.

83
00:05:23,160 --> 00:05:25,840
Are you trying to pull a trick in front of Master ?

84
00:05:26,320 --> 00:05:28,840
No need, just take care of Miss Li.

85
00:05:30,560 --> 00:05:31,360
Understood.

86
00:05:31,800 --> 00:05:32,600
Senior !

87
00:05:34,360 --> 00:05:35,240
Be careful...

88
00:05:39,920 --> 00:05:42,240
They need to set up this big formation

89
00:05:42,320 --> 00:05:43,920
so it's the perfect time to attack.
